# Cenários do README para o cliente HTTP do IntelliJ.
# Suba a stack antes: docker compose up -d --build --wait
# Cada bloco começa com um pré-checkout, que guarda o cartId para os pedidos seguintes.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### Pré-checkout de um plano
POST {{host}}/operations/pre-checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"products": [{"slug": "premium"}]}

> {% client.global.set("cartId", response.body.cartId); %}

### Pagamento recusado: cartão terminado em 0002 (422 PAYMENT_DECLINED)
POST {{host}}/operations/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cartId": "{{cartId}}",
  "paymentMethod": {
    "name": "Cartão de Crédito",
    "card": {"holderName": "Ana Souza", "number": "4000000000000002", "expiry": "12/30", "cvv": "123"}
  }
}

### Nova tentativa no mesmo carrinho, com o cartão do enunciado (200 APROVADO)
POST {{host}}/operations/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cartId": "{{cartId}}",
  "paymentMethod": {
    "name": "Cartão de Crédito",
    "card": {"holderName": "Ana Souza", "number": "4111111111114242", "expiry": "12/28", "cvv": "123"}
  }
}

### Pagar de novo o carrinho aprovado (409 CART_ALREADY_PAID)
POST {{host}}/operations/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"cartId": "{{cartId}}", "paymentMethod": {"name": "Pix"}}

### Pré-checkout com dois planos, para o Pix
POST {{host}}/operations/pre-checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"products": [{"slug": "basico"}, {"slug": "familia"}]}

> {% client.global.set("cartId", response.body.cartId); %}

### Pix (200, com pixCode no formato do endToEndId)
POST {{host}}/operations/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"cartId": "{{cartId}}", "paymentMethod": {"name": "Pix"}}

### Pré-checkout para o teste de idempotência
POST {{host}}/operations/pre-checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"products": [{"slug": "familia"}]}

> {% client.global.set("cartId", response.body.cartId); %}

### Idempotency-Key: rode este pedido duas vezes e compare as respostas (mesmo paidAt)
POST {{host}}/operations/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: pedido-{{cartId}}

{
  "cartId": "{{cartId}}",
  "paymentMethod": {
    "name": "Cartão de Débito",
    "card": {"holderName": "Ana Souza", "number": "4242424242424242", "expiry": "12/30", "cvv": "123"}
  }
}

### Mesma chave com outro cartão (422 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED)
POST {{host}}/operations/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: pedido-{{cartId}}

{
  "cartId": "{{cartId}}",
  "paymentMethod": {
    "name": "Cartão de Débito",
    "card": {"holderName": "Ana Souza", "number": "5555555555554444", "expiry": "12/30", "cvv": "123"}
  }
}

### Produto inexistente (422 PRODUCT_NOT_FOUND, cartId null)
POST {{host}}/operations/pre-checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"products": [{"slug": "inexistente"}]}

### Carrinho inexistente (404 CART_NOT_FOUND)
POST {{host}}/operations/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"cartId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "paymentMethod": {"name": "Pix"}}

### Pré-checkout para os erros de dado de pagamento
POST {{host}}/operations/pre-checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"products": [{"slug": "basico"}]}

> {% client.global.set("cartId", response.body.cartId); %}

### Meio fora do carrinho: Boleto vem desabilitado do serviço de meios (422 PAYMENT_METHOD_NOT_ALLOWED)
POST {{host}}/operations/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"cartId": "{{cartId}}", "paymentMethod": {"name": "Boleto"}}

### Cartão vencido (400 INVALID_PAYMENT_DATA)
POST {{host}}/operations/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cartId": "{{cartId}}",
  "paymentMethod": {
    "name": "Cartão de Crédito",
    "card": {"holderName": "Ana Souza", "number": "4242424242424242", "expiry": "01/20", "cvv": "123"}
  }
}

### Cartão enviado no Pix (400 INVALID_PAYMENT_DATA)
POST {{host}}/operations/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cartId": "{{cartId}}",
  "paymentMethod": {
    "name": "Pix",
    "card": {"holderName": "Ana Souza", "number": "4242424242424242", "expiry": "12/30", "cvv": "123"}
  }
}

### Resposta perdida e troca de meio (cenário 10 do README)
# Antes, suba o BFF com o gateway mais lento que o prazo: PAYMENT_GATEWAY_LATENCY=12s docker compose up -d --wait bff
POST {{host}}/operations/pre-checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"products": [{"slug": "premium"}]}

> {% client.global.set("cartId", response.body.cartId); %}

### Cartão: 503 depois de 10 s, mas o gateway simulado já registrou a cobrança
POST {{host}}/operations/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cartId": "{{cartId}}",
  "paymentMethod": {
    "name": "Cartão de Crédito",
    "card": {"holderName": "Ana Souza", "number": "4242424242424242", "expiry": "12/30", "cvv": "123"}
  }
}

### Pix no mesmo carrinho: 409 CART_ALREADY_PAID, a cobrança do cartão é encontrada e o Pix não é cobrado
POST {{host}}/operations/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"cartId": "{{cartId}}", "paymentMethod": {"name": "Pix"}}

### Readiness
GET {{host}}/actuator/health/readiness
